 "note": "seeded Gemma 4 (Gemma4ForConditionalGeneration, text only), 4 layers: 0 and 2 sliding (window 5, head_dim 16, 2 KV heads, rope theta 10000), 1 and 3 full (global_head_dim 32, 1 KV head, attention_k_eq_v: no v_proj, proportional rope theta 1e6 with a quarter of the head rotating); hidden 64, 4 heads, a dense GeGLU of 64 beside 8 experts of width 32, 3 per token (router: RMSNorm without weight times scale and hidden^-0.5, softmax, top 3 renormed, times per_expert_scale); final_logit_softcapping 3; layer_scalar between 0.6 and 1.4; tied head; BF16 weights. The contract is model.safetensors + config.json in the form of the published checkpoints (text_config, tensors under model.language_model., no lm_head). Per case (5, 13, 29 tokens): embed, layerNN, layer00_attn, layer00_mlp (the dense block), norm, logits (all positions, soft-capped), greedy (24 tokens, no eos) with the top-2 margin - checked equal with the transformers cache and without. rope.cos / rope.sin [64, 8]: the sliding set; rope2.cos / rope2.sin [64, 16]: the full set (pairs 4..15 do not rotate)",
